# The API image needs only its runtime sources, migrations, lockfiles, tests, and
# the three canonical root examples. Everything else (especially credentials and
# live planning/runner data) stays outside the build context.
**
!api/
!api/Dockerfile
!api/requirements.lock
!api/requirements-dev.lock
!api/pyproject.toml
!api/alembic.ini
!api/app/
!api/app/**
!api/migrations/
!api/migrations/**
!api/tests/
!api/tests/**
# API tests compare backlog parsing with the repository's compatibility helper.
!scripts/
!scripts/backlog.py
!PROJECT.md.example
!AGENTS.md.example
!BACKLOG.md.example
api/**/__pycache__/
api/**/.pytest_cache/
api/**/.mypy_cache/
api/**/.ruff_cache/
api/**/*.pyc
api/**/.env
api/**/.env.*
